AI-Powered Financial Management App - Development Prompt (Vertex AI + TiDB)

Project Overview

Build a Python backend system for an early wage access app with AI-driven financial goal management using money jars/buckets, deployed on Vertex AI with TiDB as the database.



Core Features to Implement

1. Early Wage Access System

Daily wage calculation and disbursement
Integration with employer payroll systems
Transaction tracking and limits

2. Money Jars (Buckets) Management

Create/update/delete financial goal buckets
Track bucket balances and progress
Support multiple concurrent goals

3. AI Agent for Smart Allocation

Analyze user financial statements
Process monthly salary data
Learn spending patterns
Auto-allocate funds to buckets based on:

Income levels
Spending habits
Financial goals priority
Risk tolerance


4. Data Extraction via MCP (Model Context Protocol)

Extract financial data from emails
Process uploaded documents (PDF, images, bank statements)
Alternative: Use LangChain with document loaders if MCP doesn't fit


Technical Stack

Backend Framework

Code
# FastAPI for REST API
# Python 3.10+
# Async/await for performance

Database

Code
- Primary: TiDB Serverless (MySQL-compatible distributed database)
- ORM: SQLAlchemy with async support (asyncmy driver)
- Migrations: Alembic
- Connection: mysql+asyncmy://

AI/ML Components

Code
- Vertex AI for model deployment and hosting
- Gemini API for document understanding
- LangChain for orchestration
- Vertex AI Vector Search for embeddings
- Vertex AI Prediction endpoints

Deployment

Code
- Vertex AI Custom Training & Prediction
- Vertex AI Workbench for development
- Vertex AI Endpoints for model serving
- Google Cloud Storage for document storage
- Cloud Run (optional) or Vertex AI serving for API


